{
 "version": 1,
 "description": "Mutants of the voxel map editor's headless part (tools/voxel_map_editor: gyo.voxel_grid, the chunked bake, the box and Goxel imports, the synthetic maps, the command line); big-map declaration section 4.1 (d1), (c) and (d2). One per independently wrong decision (tests/common/mutation/README.md, criteria 1 to 3 and 9). Run from the repository root: python3 -B tests/common/mutation/run_mutations.py --build-dir <build> --cmake <cmake> --catalog tests/voxel_map_editor/mutations.json. The vme-cli- mutants find the executable at <build>/../../_tools/voxel_map_editor/bin (the default GYO_OUTPUT_ROOT with the build tree under build/target/_build) and run on macOS and Linux only. Not added (with the reason): WriteMap's comparison of the read-back chunks with the baked ones (the writer and the reader agree, so no test can make them differ: an equivalent mutant); the order of SaveMap's steps (regions, index, stale removal: a test would need a failure in the middle of a save; each step is tested on its own); the per-rule mutants of the voxel_map Module itself (tests/common/voxel_map/mutations.json).",
